{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-09-26 07:00:00', 'title': "CENTENE SUBSIDIARY SELECTED TO CONTINUE SERVING NEBRASKA'S MEDICAID MANAGED CARE MEMBERS", 'text': 'ST. LOUIS , SEPT. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS NEBRASKA SUBSIDIARY, NEBRASKA TOTAL CARE, HAS BEEN AWARDED THE NEBRASKA DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH AND HUMAN SERVICES (DHHS) STATEWIDE MEDICAID MANAGED CARE CONTRACT.'}